\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs24 75rectoa (Prolog:) \plain \f1\i\fs24 Cupientes aliquid de penuria. Huic operi Magister praemittit prooemium\u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs24  75rectob (Text:) \plain \f1\i\fs24 Veteris ... Finito prooemio hic incipit tractatus. Et dividitur in duas partes\u8230 \'85
