\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs24 54rectoa: \plain \f1\i\fs24 Utrum per sacram scripturam possit efficaciter probari finalis salus Salomonis\u8230 \'85
