\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\fs24 56rectob-107versoa: Robertus <Holcot>: In quattuor libros Sententiarum quaestiones (lib. II, I, III)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs24 56rectob: \plain \f1\i\fs24 Distinctione prima secundi libri Magister agit de creatione hominis\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\fs24 56rectob: \plain \f1\i\fs24 Quaero istam quaestionem: Utrum creator generis humani iuste gubernet genus humanum\u8230 \'85
