\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs24 292recto: \plain \f1\i\fs24 Reverendi patres magistri et domini venerabiles. Iuxta ritum almae theologiae facultatis Parisiis\u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs24  292recto: \plain \f1\i\fs24 Dedi te in lucem gentium\plain \f1\fs24  - (Is 49,6) \plain \f1\i\fs24 Ad cuius thematis introductionem ac lucis huius\u8230 \'85
