\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs24 25rectoa (Kommentar:) \plain \f1\i\fs24 Sicut dicit Constantinus: Humores temperamentum exeuntes\u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs24  26rectoa (Text:) \plain \f1\i\fs24 Medicina aequivocatur a duo\u8230 \'85 
