\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\fs24 122rectoa-173rectob: Ali ibn Ridwan (Haly Rodohan) 'Commentarius super Tegni seu arte parva Galeni' in der \u220 \'dcbersetzung des Constantinus Africanus
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs24 122rectoa (Prolog:) \plain \f1\i\fs24 Intendimus edere sermonem exponentem id quod clausum est\u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs24  122rectoa (Text:) \plain \f1\i\fs24 Tres sunt omnes doctrinae quae ordine habentur\u8230 \'85\plain \f1\fs24  122rectoa (Kommentar:) \plain \f1\i\fs24 In omnibus doctrinis quae currunt secundum ordinem\u8230 \'85
