\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 1rectoa (Prolog:) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Seneca dicit in epistulis suis quod homo cum bonum proprium perfecerit\u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  3versob (Text:) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 'Cum sit necessarium'. Secundum quod scitis cognitio uniuscuiusque rei dependet ex suis causis...
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 
