\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\fs24 72versob-76rectoa: Petrus <de Godino>: Quaestio disputata 'De principio individuationis: Utrum materia' (contra Iohannem Duns Scotum)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs24 72versob: \plain \f1\i\fs24 Utrum materia sit principium individuationis\u8230 \'85
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
