\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 1rectoa-28rectob: Bartholomaeus Salernitanus: Commentarius in 'Isagogen' Iohannitii (Bartholomaeus I)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\fs24 1rectoa (Prolog:) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Rectus ordo doctrinae per singulas rerum artes subiacentium\u8230 \'85\plain \f2\fs24  2rectoa (Text:) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Medicina dividitur in duas partes etc. Iohannitius medicinalis artis principia\u8230 \'85 
