\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs24 (neu:) Collegium ad Portam Coeli, Erfurt, 50 medicinae \u183 \'b7 Papier \u183 \'b7 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5706[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 134 Bl.}}\plain \f1\fs24  \u183 \'b7 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5360[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\fs24\chcbpat17 21 x 15}}\plain \f1\fs24  \u183 \'b7 Erfurt \u183 \'b7 1392/1393}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs16 (Schum:) Vorbesitzer: Bl. 102. Completa est summa ypothesium artis medicine que communiter apud Latinos introductiones et apud Grecos ysagoge nuncupantur Ar. de V. n., propter brevitatis eulogium dicti Arvillanus, doctoris in medicina subtilissimi, Erphordie 1393o die 15. m. Marcii in archa, que non est Noe, sed Amplonii de Berka, cum D. adiutorio terminata. -- Bl. 109. Von anderer Hand: Finitus est tract. de reg. acute febricitancium, excerptus ab immensa profunditatis prolixitate subtilis doctoris Arn. de V. n. 1393o Erphordie in archa, que non est Noe, sed Amplonii de Berka. -- Bl. 131 wieder von der sp\u228 \'e4teren Hand: Liber parabolarum Arn. de V. n. doctoris eximii valde Amplonio de Berka pertinens sub a. D. 1392o divisione apostolorum sanctorum; zweifellos gleich Cat. Ampl. Medic. 50.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\fs24 (neu:) Bl. 1-110 befanden sich 1393 im Besitz des Amplonius, vgl. Schreibervermerke, 104rectob: \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Completa est summa Erfordiae 1393 die 15. mensis Martii in Archa, quae non est Noe, sed Amplonii de Berka, cum Dei adiutorio terminata\plain \f1\fs24 , 110versob: \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Finitus est tractatus 1393 Erfordiae in Archa, quae non est Noe, sed Amplonii de Berka\plain \f1\fs24 ; Bl. 123-134 waren schon 1392 in seinem Besitz, vgl. Besitzvermerk, 134verso: \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Liber parabolarum Arnoldi de Villa nova doctoris eximii valde Amplonio de Berka pertinens sub anno Domini 1392 divisione apostolorum sanctorum. \plain \f1\fs24 Der gesamte Codex 1410/12 im eigenh\u228 \'e4ndigen Katalog des Amplonius als 50 medicinae, in der Bibliothek des \u8218 \'82Collegium Porta Coeli\rquote  gleichfalls als 50 medicinae.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset1 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;}

