\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 11recto-58verso: Liber de quodlibet ex libris philosophorum et Avicennae Parisius disputatus (Liber II secundum ordinem alphabeti)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 11recto: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Anima: In comparatione materiae est forma\u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  15recto: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Abrotanum: Semen eius cum aqua tritum vel potum suspiriosis\u8230 \'85
